WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.270
To remove a task, click the cross at the end of its row.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:10.010
Tidy asks first. Click Delete to confirm, or Cancel to keep it.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.710
Click a task's name to open its own page.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:19.250
Write what you need to remember in Notes, then click Save notes.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.230
And All tasks takes you back to the list.
